<td>
Description: Passengers of the Mayflower signing the "Mayflower Compact" including Carver, Winslow, Alden, Myles Standish, Howland, Bradford, Allerton, and Fuller. 1 photomechanical print&#160;: halftone, color (postcard made from painting). Postcard published by The Foundation Press, Inc., 1932. Reproduction of oil painting from series: <i>The Pageant of a Nation</i>.</td>
</tr>

